    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "kwanjula",
        "title": "Kwanjula",
        "body": [
          "Katika **kwanjula**, familia ya bwana harusi hutembelea nyumbani kwa bibi harusi na zawadi nyingi. Msemaji huzungumza kwa niaba ya kila upande, na **ssenga** (shangazi) wa bibi harusi ana nafasi kuu, akimwongoza na kumtambulisha bwana harusi. Ni kama sherehe ya kujitambulisha na kutoa mahari katika jamii nyingi za Afrika Mashariki.",
          "Wanawake huvaa **gomesi** na wanaume **kkanzu** (Kipengele 10). Siku huishia kwa chakula, muziki na ngoma."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "wishes",
        "title": "Kumtakia mtu mema",
        "body": [
          "**Nkwagaliza** maana yake “ninakutakia”: ongeza unachotaka: **Nkwagaliza amazaalibwa amalungi** (siku njema ya kuzaliwa). Kwa kikundi, sema **Mbaagaliza** (ninawatakia). **Kulika** humpongeza mtu kwa jambo alilofanya: harusi, mtoto mchanga, safari. Ni kama **hongera** ya Kiswahili.",
          "Angalia kiambishi cha mtendwa: **n-ku-agaliza** (nina-ku-takia) na **m-ba-agaliza** (nina-wa-takia), kama Kiswahili **ni-na-ku-takia** na **ni-na-wa-takia**."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "Kila mtu anachangia",
        "body": [
          "Harusi mara nyingi hulipiwa kwa pamoja: marafiki na ndugu hufanya vikao vya maandalizi na kuahidi michango. Kualikwa kwenye kikao kunamaanisha uko karibu na familia, sawa na vikao vya harusi Tanzania na Kenya."
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "stories": [
    {
      "id": "the-kwanjula",
      "title": "Utambulisho",
      "unlockAfter": "u28s3l3",
      "cast": [
        "nakato",
        "jjajja"
      ],
      "summary": "Nakato anajiandaa kwa kwanjula ya binamu yake pamoja na Jjajja.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "jjajja",
            "target": "Nakato, oyambadde gomesi yo?",
            "base": "Nakato, umevaa gomesi yako?"
          },
          "gloss": {
            "oyambadde": "umevaa"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "nakato",
            "target": "Yee, Jjajja. Nnungi?",
            "base": "Ndiyo, Bibi. Ni nzuri?"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "jjajja",
            "target": "Nnungi nnyo! Ekirabo kiri wa?",
            "base": "Nzuri sana! Zawadi iko wapi?"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "nakato",
            "target": "Kiri wano. Sukaali n’omunnyo.",
            "base": "Iko hapa. Sukari na chumvi."
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Nakato analeta zawadi gani?",
          "options": [
            "Keki",
            "Sukari na chumvi",
            "Jembe"
          ],
          "answer": 1
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "jjajja",
            "target": "Kirungi. Ssenga ayamba omugole.",
            "base": "Vizuri. Shangazi anamsaidia bibi harusi."
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "nakato",
            "target": "Abagenyi bangi nnyo!",
            "base": "Wageni ni wengi sana!"
          },
          "gloss": {
            "Abagenyi": "wageni"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "jjajja",
            "target": "Yee. Leero tujaguza.",
            "base": "Ndiyo. Leo tunasherehekea."
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Nani anamsaidia bibi harusi katika kwanjula?",
          "options": [
            "Ssenga",
            "Kabaka",
            "Mwalimu"
          ],
          "answer": 0
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "nakato",
            "target": "Kulika, mugole! Nkwagaliza obulamu obulungi!",
            "base": "Hongera, bibi harusi! Ninakutakia maisha mema!"
          },
          "gloss": {
            "obulamu": "maisha"
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Nakato anasemaje “ninakutakia”?",
          "options": [
            "Nkwagaliza",
            "Nkwagala",
            "Nkulinze"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "optionsLang": "target"
        },
        {
          "line": {
